@startuml selma_inspection_pipeline
' ============================================================
' Selma — Inspection Execution Pipeline
' Source:  docs/spec/contracts/inspection/pipeline.yaml
'          docs/spec/contracts/inspection/finding_contract.yaml
' C4:      Rule Inspector → Snapshots Adapter → artifacts
'          Rule Inspector → Lifecycle Finder (finding birth)
' Contract: 1.0.0
' ============================================================

title Selma — Inspection Execution Pipeline\n<size:12><i>Hierarchical six-stage pure evaluation · typed faults · immutable snapshot</i></size>

!include ./common/sm_styles.puml

[*] --> Submitted : <b>InspectionSubmitted</b>\nactor: Compliance Representative | System\ncommand: inspection.submit | reinspect\n[capability: inspection.submit | inspection.reinspect]\nstory: US-IP-001 / US-IP-001

state "Submitted" as Submitted #B9770E : **entry** target payload received\n**allowed** ingress check only\n**forbidden** evaluate without pin
state "Ingress\nGranted" as IngressGranted #1B7A6E : **entry** capability + schema OK\n**allowed** set point-in-time pins\n**forbidden** mutate prior snapshots\npins: target_hash · cg_ir_snapshot_hash\nfrozen_env_hash · engine_version
state "Rejected\nIngress" as RejectedIngress #A93226 : **entry** 403 | SchemaError **terminal**\n**allowed** denial audit only\n**forbidden** snapshot · findings

' ---------- Hierarchical composite: six pure stages ----------
state "Pure Stages" as PureStages #1B7A6E {
  [*] --> Normalize
  state "1. Normalize" as Normalize #1B7A6E : **entry** NFC · UTC · IEEE 754\n**allowed** compute target_hash\n**forbidden** evaluator IO
  state "2. Classify" as Classify #1B7A6E : **entry** target_type mapping\n**allowed** context enrichment\n**forbidden** finding birth
  state "3. Select\nControls" as SelectControls #1B7A6E : **entry** scope filter CG-IR\n**allowed** deps ready · severity gate\n**forbidden** cascade on dependency fail
  state "4. Evaluate" as Evaluate #1B7A6E : **entry** topological DAG pure evaluators\n**allowed** Pass|Fail|Partial|NeedsReview\nparallel independent nodes\n**forbidden** IO · randomness · env reads
  state "5. Aggregate" as Aggregate #1B7A6E : **entry** deontic × outcome\n**allowed** conflict apply · severity map\n**forbidden** mutate CG-IR
  state "6. Report" as Report #2C6E49 : **entry** append findings · write snapshot+trace\n**allowed** system_state_hash seal\n**forbidden** modify completed snapshot

  Normalize --> Classify : <b>InspectionStagePassed</b>\nactor: System\n/ stageNormalize()
  Normalize --> Report : <b>InspectionStageFault</b>\nactor: System\n/ schemaOrCorruption()

  Classify --> SelectControls : <b>InspectionStagePassed</b>\nactor: System\n/ stageClassify()
  Classify --> Report : <b>InspectionStageFault</b>\nactor: System\n/ schemaFault()

  SelectControls --> Evaluate : <b>InspectionStagePassed</b>\nactor: System\n/ stageSelectControls()
  SelectControls --> Report : <b>InspectionNodesSkipped</b>\nactor: System\n/ skippedNodesOnlyNoFinding()

  Evaluate --> Aggregate : <b>InspectionStagePassed</b>\nactor: System\n/ stageEvaluate()
  ' Internal retry: do not re-fire entry side effects (STM-018)
  Evaluate : <b>InspectionEvalRetried</b>\nactor: System\n[retryCountLessThanMaxRetries]\n/ infrastructureTimeoutOnly()\n/ maxRetries3Default0()
  Evaluate --> Report : <b>InspectionStageFault</b>\nactor: System\n/ deterministicOrAmbiguousOrTimeoutOrResource()

  Aggregate --> Report : <b>InspectionAggregated</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: OK or partial aggregate (always report)
  Report --> [*] : <b>ReportSealed</b>\nactor: System
}

state "Completed" as Completed #2C6E49 : **entry** status=completed **terminal**\n**allowed** read-only analytics\n**forbidden** mutate
state "Partial" as Partial #B9770E : **entry** status=partial · skipped_nodes\n**allowed** read-only · reinspect new id\n**forbidden** backfill skipped into same id
state "Failed" as Failed #A93226 : **entry** status=failed · fatal CG-IR\n**allowed** audit · reinspect new id\n**forbidden** partial publish as completed

Submitted --> IngressGranted : <b>InspectionIngressGranted</b>\nactor: System (Application Service)\n[capabilityEnforcedAtIngress]
Submitted --> RejectedIngress : <b>InspectionIngressDenied</b>\nactor: System\n/ status403OrSchemaErrorNoSnapshot()

RejectedIngress --> [*] : <b>Finalized</b>\nactor: System

IngressGranted --> PureStages : <b>InspectionPinned</b>\nactor: System (Rule Inspector)\ncommand: pin target_hash + cg_ir + frozen_env + engine\n/ fixSystemStateHashInputs()\n/ excludeEventStreamFromHash()

' Outcomes after Report completes the composite
PureStages --> Completed : <b>InspectionCompleted</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: write snapshot + birth findings\n[noSkippedNodesAndNoFatalCorruption]\n/ birthFindingsForFailPartialNeedsReview()
PureStages --> Partial : <b>InspectionPartial</b>\nactor: System\n[skippedNodesPresent]
PureStages --> Failed : <b>InspectionFailed</b>\nactor: System

Completed --> [*] : <b>Finalized</b>\nactor: System
Partial --> [*] : <b>Finalized</b>\nactor: System
Failed --> [*] : <b>Finalized</b>\nactor: System

@enduml
